<title>BELARUS: TABLE-Belarus H1 GDP rises 11 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belarus H1 GDP rises 11 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus gross domestic product in the first six months of this year totalled 135.2 trillion Belarussian roubles, 11 percent more than a year earlier in inflation-adjusted terms, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p>GDP in June was 12 percent higher than a year earlier, the ministry said.</p>
<p>    BELARUS GDP			  June 97    May 97    June 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	+13.0	 +4.0     +15.0</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  +12.0	 +3.0	+2.0</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
</text>
